    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/43b71a77cf9f3bea95ff43456dd3b81b.poster.avif?t=1739447715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/43b71a77cf9f3bea95ff43456dd3b81b.webm?t=1739447715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2666 Different environments/biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 New races, bosses and secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/c32d9e8e1d938ef72b7b514c76a83f49.poster.avif?t=1739447715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/c32d9e8e1d938ef72b7b514c76a83f49.webm?t=1739447715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2666 CO-OP mode between VR and PC </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 Play with 4 of your friends and try different cooperative mechanics to change the course of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/7c44f85f9d0724eda2d875f0237115ec.poster.avif?t=1739447715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/7c44f85f9d0724eda2d875f0237115ec.webm?t=1739447715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2666 Build your loadout</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 Choose whatever weapons or spells you like </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/89b50d84186d152792075bd6eb2539cf.poster.avif?t=1739447715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/89b50d84186d152792075bd6eb2539cf.webm?t=1739447715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2666 Use these weapons in a wide variety of ways to: decapitate, freeze or maul, anyway your imagination can go, to advance your standing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/833ae985033cd1facfc67a95dbf7ef76.poster.avif?t=1739447715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/833ae985033cd1facfc67a95dbf7ef76.webm?t=1739447715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2666 Play a tactical game of MOBA: Either on pc from a third person view or from VR and immerse yourself in the heroes POV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/330ba1cb36a945c3111cfc025c8fc68d.poster.avif?t=1739447715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/330ba1cb36a945c3111cfc025c8fc68d.webm?t=1739447715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2666 Choose which of the Architects you wish to serve and join the ranks of their acolytes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 Unlock special abilities and weapons from the faction you serve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/b03a588b8c433dbc41ec7d90b1a6d4c4.poster.avif?t=1739447715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/b03a588b8c433dbc41ec7d90b1a6d4c4.webm?t=1739447715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2666 In a new multiplayer mode, gather your friends and wage war against npc-s or other players that are hungry for the lands you wish to own</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/43b71a77cf9f3bea95ff43456dd3b81b.poster.avif?t=1739447715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/43b71a77cf9f3bea95ff43456dd3b81b.webm?t=1739447715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2666 Different environments/biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 New races, bosses and secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/c32d9e8e1d938ef72b7b514c76a83f49.poster.avif?t=1739447715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/c32d9e8e1d938ef72b7b514c76a83f49.webm?t=1739447715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2666 CO-OP mode between VR and PC </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 Play with 4 of your friends and try different cooperative mechanics to change the course of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/7c44f85f9d0724eda2d875f0237115ec.poster.avif?t=1739447715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/7c44f85f9d0724eda2d875f0237115ec.webm?t=1739447715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2666 Build your loadout</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 Choose whatever weapons or spells you like </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap