h\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/b03a588b8c433dbc41ec7d90b1a6d4c4.poster.avif?t=1739447715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037380/extras/b03a588b8c433dbc41ec7d90b1a6d4c4.webm?t=1739447715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>\u2666 In a new multiplayer mode, gather your friends and wage war against npc-s or other players that are hungry for the lands you wish to own</p>",
